<title>UK: NAB sets $300 million two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>NAB sets $300 million two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL AUSTRALIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	SPREAD     -6.25 BP  MATURITY    16.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.058   FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  REOFFER    100.058</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
